        "heading": "Flutter vs Native App Development",
        "body": "Choosing between Flutter and native development depends on the application.\n\nFlutter can be a strong option when Android and iOS applications provide similar functionality.\n\nNative development can make more sense where the application depends heavily on platform-specific APIs, specialist hardware, advanced background processing, or distinctly different experiences between Android and iOS.",
