        "body": "Flutter and React Native are both popular approaches to cross-platform mobile development, but they use different technologies and development models.\n\nThe right choice depends on your product requirements, existing team skills, UI complexity, integrations, long-term roadmap, and architecture.\n\nIf React Native is more suitable for your product, explore our [React Native development services](/mobile-development/react-native-development).\n\nYou can also review our broader [cross-platform app development services](/mobile-development/cross-platform-app-development) when the framework has not yet been selected.",
        "items": []
